{"type":"message","id":"fd6acadc","parentId":"8419bd1c","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:17:07.411Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint returns error code 1101 regardless of header format. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error code - 1101 is \"Worker threw exception\" or \"Worker not implemented\". The GET endpoints work fine but POST might not be implemented or there's an issue with the endpoint.\n\nLet me try different approaches - maybe the body format is wrong, or the endpoint path is different, or something else.\n\nActually, error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker threw a JavaScript exception\" or \"Worker returned an error\". The GET works because there's no body, but POST with a body might cause the worker to fail.\n\nLet me try a simple POST with minimal or no body, or with different content types.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-d88ab53c-3ec3-4c4f-9b1e-444258b00647","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with different content types and body\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\" \\\n  -d 'heartbeat test'\n\necho \"---\"\n\n# Try as form\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\n  -d \"threadId=arbitration&content=heartbeat\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18743,"output":325,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19180,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779189419982,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e4d296ce-d95a-448f-ad26-855054038ce9"}}
