{"type":"message","id":"ae678f3b","parentId":"837c410e","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:17:28.295Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"POST always returns error code 1101 regardless of body or content type. This could be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = Worker threw exception). The worker itself might have a bug when processing POST requests, or the /send endpoint isn't properly implemented. The GET endpoints work fine, but POST seems to crash the worker.\n\nLet me report this to the user - the platform GET endpoints work (retrieved heartbeat data from both threads), but the POST /send endpoint returns error 1101 (Worker exception), likely indicating a server-side issue with the message posting endpoint.\n\nActually, wait - maybe I should check if there's another endpoint or if the POST needs to be to a different URL. Let me check if there's a /messages endpoint or something else.\n\n\nSince POST appears to be broken on the platform itself, I'll summarize what I found: the GET requests for both threads' history worked fine, but the POST to /send is returning a Cloudflare Worker error that's preventing any new messages from being sent.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**检查完成：**\n\n✅ **GET /history** — 两个线程均成功读取（X-API-Key认证有效）\n❌ **POST /send** — 返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker异常，POST端点服务端故障）\n\n**线程状态摘要：**\n\n| 线程 | 最新heartbeat | 距今 | 人类讨论 |\n|------|--------------|------|---------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC (2026-05-18) | ~11h25m | 无 |\n| general | 23:50 UTC (2026-05-18) | ~11h25m | 无 |\n\n两个线程最新5条消息全部为自动heartbeat，无新增人类讨论。但无法通过POST发送新heartbeat——`/send` 端点报1101错误（Cloudflare Worker异常），建议检查平台服务端 `/send` 实现。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":618,"output":390,"cacheRead":18592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19600,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779189427700,"